### CampusQuest Notes Tests

### 1. Get Notes by Subject ID
GET http://localhost:5000/subjects/1/notes

### 2. Get Notes filtered by Subject ID and Unit
GET http://localhost:5000/subjects/1/notes?unit=1

### 3. Get Single Note by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/notes/1

### 4. Create Note (Admin Only)
POST http://localhost:5000/notes
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "subject_id": 1,
    "unit": 4,
    "title": "Unit 4: Transaction Processing & Recovery",
    "description": "ACID properties, serializability, log-based recovery, checkpoints.",
    "content": "### Unit 4: Transactions and Recovery\n\n- ACID Principles\n- WAL (Write-Ahead Logging)\n- 2-Phase Locking protocol",
    "file_url": "/uploads/notes/dbms_unit4.pdf"
}
